  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.20 Examination Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Real Estate Commission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.20 Examination Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Real Estate Commission. The examination fees for the professions regulated by the real estate commission under RSA 331-A shall be as follows:\n\n(a) For real estate brokers, $36 for the national portion and $34 for the state portion; and\n\n(b) For real estate salespersons, $34 for the national portion and $32 for the state portion.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.18)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
